  "title": "Days, months and time",
  "note": "Weekdays are counted from Sunday: segunda-feira (Monday) is the \"second day,\" and -feira is often dropped: na segunda. Days and months are written in lowercase. For clock time use São... for hours above one (São duas horas) and É... for one o'clock, noon and midnight.",
